    "created_at": "2017-02-16T06:58:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-16T06:58:04Z",
    "body": ">Now, we ignore the user-scalable, min-scale and max-scale settings. If you have content that disabled zoom, please test it on iOS 10, and understand that many users will be zooming now.\r\nhttps://webkit.org/blog/7367/new-interaction-behaviors-in-ios-10/",
